window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>One cure. One promise. One impossible love.</b></p> <p>The forest is rotting. The skies churn with dark magic. And no one can trust what they see, not even themselves.</p> <p>A sinister power pulses from Draego’s prison, twisting reality and infecting the minds of everyone in the Foximite Tribe. Love turns to fear, memory to illusion, and truth to lies. Caught in a web of hallucinations, Lawrence can no longer tell whether Bianca is in his arms… or someone else’s. As visions of marriage and betrayal blur together, one thing remains clear: he would give everything to protect her.</p> <p>Bianca, haunted by ghostly flashes of her past, uncovers a deadly secret, one that links Armand to her mother in an unimaginable way. But when the only man with the cure demands a heartbreaking sacrifice, she’s forced to make an impossible choice.</p> <p>As Draego’s power grows, the zombie wolves close in, hungry for their master’s freedom. Alliances fracture. Loyalties burn. And love, in its purest form, must fight through the fog of madness.</p> <p>In a world where fantasy and nightmare collide, can Lawrence protect Bianca from the chaos….<i>and from himself?</i></p> <p>His to Protect will leave you breathless… and begging for more.</p>"; 
